        "Description": "Forensic reports from the isle of Sgail paint a grim picture. In a fit of fiery rage, Jebediah Block executed Louis Bryant with an ancient battle axe, only to supposedly take his own life shortly after by drawning in a toilet bowl! A convenient narrative - and one that requires your direct intervention.",
